DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270313
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
SUMMARY:Skyrian Carnival (Apokries)
LOCATION:Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Among the most distinctive carnivals in Greece — the 'Yeros' figure dressed in goat skins and bells dances through the village. Pre-Christian roots\, deeply Skyrian.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#skyrian-carnival-apokries
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#skyrian-carnival-apokries
END:VEVENT
