BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skyros-trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Trachy and Marmaro
LOCATION:Trachy / Marmaro\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Two chapels of Agios Panteleimon keep the feast on 26-27 July\, at Trachy on the road to the airport and at Marmaro in the north. Skyrian panigiria follow the same script: vespers\, then the tavles\, long tables where pilaf and roast goat or lamb are served to all comers\, and violin-and-lute music until morning. Both are reachable only by car\; bring a jumper\, the north of the island is windy at night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm
END:VEVENT
