BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skyros-skyros-chora-area-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-megklou-and--2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia (15 August)\, Megklou and Pathima
LOCATION:Skyros Chora area\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Skyros keeps Dekapentavgoustos at the chapels of Panagia Megklou (14-15 August) and Panagia Pathima (eve of the 14th)\, with the usual tavles and all-night music\, and on the 15th the island's Skyrian wedding re-enactment in the Chora. It is peak season on a small island with one ferry a day from Kymi\, so accommodation and the boat need booking well ahead.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#skyros-chora-area-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-megklou-and-
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#skyros-chora-area-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-megklou-and-
END:VEVENT
